<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Thursday 105,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Thursday 105,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Thursday's est receipts 105,000, Wk ago 93,000, and Yr ago 104,000 head at interior Iowa Minnesota. Estimates include generally about 65 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts were steady to $0.50 lower compared with mid-session Wednesday. Trade was slow to moderate for light to moderate demand and offerings. Top $58.50 per cwt.</p>
